{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "I don’t want less food.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/96d0f4fd3f7da04a89c6998640da16b6c08d28a201f88ade4ecfca4ea30da7b7.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.2], [4, 1.2, 1.66]]}, {"text": "I want healthier food that doesn’t spike my blood sugar or leave me feeling awful afterward.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/840b7f04daa43101c99823f54aee65f9fd03ad92fa0556ca31ce4c85ff3fd903.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 1.0], [4, 1.0, 1.24], [5, 1.24, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 2.1], [8, 2.1, 2.28], [9, 2.28, 2.6], [10, 2.6, 2.88], [11, 2.88, 3.16], [12, 3.16, 3.38], [13, 3.38, 3.74], [14, 3.74, 4.14], [15, 4.14, 4.82]]}, {"text": "I want food that tastes good and makes me feel good.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d6754a958164eea061cdd3d7c0a62c2e925062c346d398d2f25e25878732ffc3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.28], [5, 1.28, 1.7], [6, 1.7, 1.96], [7, 1.96, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.3], [9, 2.3, 2.52], [10, 2.52, 2.7]]}, {"text": "There are four knobs (STEAM):", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/29bd54efebda756c88a055e06757002f37645b81d7134042115028e80f9172f1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.98]]}, {"text": "Stimulation", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4e937e0851c1adee63317f9224134f1cf2e5f127c3c4c83dbbb898937be693d1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.66]]}, {"text": "Access", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b69f15aa0c81f0575a12bd2945f17930197ff3831e7f84cca348870dfc682c36.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48]]}, {"text": "Endlessness", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4ceb8734c6f82d4c345860b54f0756fef57b42b724b520ac24f8498c2c4fa0c0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.72]]}, {"text": "Anticipation", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/94faa0690f1172d2b1fa0428c840a57fbdfa5454d3da63664a707ccc16fd2089.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.8]]}, {"text": "A Costco-sized pack of shelf-stable sweets sitting within arm’s reach of my workstation maxes out every knob.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/23422df0e38daa237f52b40bd0bc392ad6f37a15e63129893f310c8773d3e36b.mp3"}, {"text": "Work stress, boredom, or hunger creates the urge for a break for a little self-soothing.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a5afff82f9c9eb6cbd385de1ea4c359dc936c1949eca5b06bd68b67586b84803.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.62], [2, 1.0, 1.36], [3, 1.36, 1.58], [4, 1.58, 1.9], [6, 2.36, 2.62], [7, 2.62, 2.88], [8, 2.88, 3.1], [9, 3.1, 3.22], [10, 3.22, 3.44], [11, 3.44, 3.64], [12, 3.64, 3.74], [13, 3.74, 3.9]]}, {"text": "Having the sweets within arm’s reach makes them effortless to access.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d7594f648a2005e603d898747366c2d294aa314b2a481a78309613f8c66e8ca3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.48], [4, 1.12, 1.48], [5, 1.48, 1.66], [6, 1.66, 1.92], [7, 1.92, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.68], [9, 2.68, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.18]]}, {"text": "A family-sized box feels almost endless to a family of one.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ed55c02357cae9c42e00a767b8472ffbc286d1ef4b947c8182a3bfaf1529f7b4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [2, 0.74, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.66], [4, 1.66, 2.04], [5, 2.04, 2.42], [6, 2.42, 2.64], [7, 2.64, 2.74], [8, 2.74, 3.02], [9, 3.02, 3.22], [10, 3.22, 3.42]]}, {"text": "There is no natural stopping point.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0b59e9993d94233ea4c44c25cf02b0ad78c0f4250b5798fe44d755b544084105.mp3"}, {"text": "And with each bite, you anticipate the next one.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b99e1166a5ae19f3e6db74a6f4155270aeb97e404d4b5ac691deeaea53eb092f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.78], [4, 1.12, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 1.92], [7, 1.92, 2.12], [8, 2.12, 2.36]]}, {"text": "I can’t skip dinner with my friends just because I had a big breakfast.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b9fdf55e9476fcfb5f2bebee12792ec02a44fcf37e947aa03d539cbd565ad7fb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [2, 0.32, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 0.94], [5, 0.94, 1.1], [6, 1.1, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 1.68], [8, 1.68, 1.98], [9, 1.98, 2.16], [10, 2.16, 2.28], [11, 2.28, 2.36], [12, 2.36, 2.52], [13, 2.52, 2.9]]}, {"text": "But I can order the salad instead of the lasagna.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0facb05c302fc9fd83f910d0edb5b20cf2f536209c1c3b0a0c9a3a3132f4b1e9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.24], [6, 1.24, 1.6], [7, 1.6, 1.8], [8, 1.8, 1.92], [9, 1.92, 2.38]]}, {"text": "Restriction attacks quantity; environment design attacks the mechanics that produce overconsumption.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/db841c974b7838030f0732fe5b303a70fb0b49c73c8c254eb32ccc65b61cc4c5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48], [1, 0.48, 0.86], [2, 0.86, 1.44], [3, 1.76, 2.1], [4, 2.1, 2.42], [5, 2.42, 2.92], [7, 3.06, 3.36], [8, 3.36, 3.64], [9, 3.64, 3.9]]}, {"text": "I don’t want less social media.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/635c76011a2964fb3d53def18ff02d565dd0fc42e73558bb0b133a24bb2385e6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.62], [4, 0.62, 1.04], [5, 1.04, 1.44]]}, {"text": "I want to consume the good parts: reconnecting with old friends, staying in touch with family, meeting new people, staying informed, and maintaining the relationships that matter to me.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/44449d63efc96513dea5978794532505a28d7201101e3e9b4d5907371850acfa.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.82], [7, 2.3, 2.84], [8, 2.84, 2.96], [9, 2.96, 3.12], [10, 3.12, 3.62], [11, 4.04, 4.34], [12, 4.34, 4.5], [13, 4.5, 4.66], [14, 4.66, 4.9], [15, 4.9, 5.3], [16, 5.88, 6.06], [17, 6.06, 6.34], [18, 6.34, 6.74], [19, 7.14, 7.32], [20, 7.32, 7.84], [21, 7.84, 8.18], [22, 8.18, 8.64], [23, 8.64, 8.86], [24, 8.86, 9.42], [25, 9.42, 9.72], [26, 9.72, 9.98], [27, 9.98, 10.16], [28, 10.16, 10.34]]}, {"text": "I want social media that helps me live a fulfilling life instead of consuming it.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d6858b2953b499fd5870a70695f571dd8c0078eeceda10f630a0dbd4958e4fdf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.12], [4, 1.12, 1.44], [5, 1.44, 1.66], [6, 1.66, 1.88], [7, 1.88, 2.08], [8, 2.08, 2.2], [9, 2.2, 2.56], [10, 2.56, 2.94], [11, 2.94, 3.38], [12, 3.38, 3.52], [13, 3.52, 3.94], [14, 3.94, 4.26]]}, {"text": "There are four knobs (STEAM):", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/29bd54efebda756c88a055e06757002f37645b81d7134042115028e80f9172f1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.98]]}, {"text": "Stimulation", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4e937e0851c1adee63317f9224134f1cf2e5f127c3c4c83dbbb898937be693d1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.66]]}, {"text": "Access", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b69f15aa0c81f0575a12bd2945f17930197ff3831e7f84cca348870dfc682c36.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48]]}, {"text": "Endlessness", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4ceb8734c6f82d4c345860b54f0756fef57b42b724b520ac24f8498c2c4fa0c0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.72]]}, {"text": "Anticipation", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/94faa0690f1172d2b1fa0428c840a57fbdfa5454d3da63664a707ccc16fd2089.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.8]]}, {"text": "Instagram knob-maxes.", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/245c8ba82cb536a836be85a24b4004a617424d03aec266b296430f4501995c11.mp3"}, {"text": "Push notifications create the urge to open the app.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e75fff9d931fa7f5ff6c0344a4435f6d45f1128a3ac5522aa9fa8c0865408de2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.86], [2, 0.86, 1.46], [3, 1.46, 1.68], [4, 1.68, 1.96], [5, 1.96, 2.18], [6, 2.18, 2.4], [7, 2.4, 2.6], [8, 2.6, 2.84]]}, {"text": "One tap makes the content immediately accessible.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/16acdeebcef963fff070911cb83631eae4b45cb8647aa71fcf3154ba9579b356.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 2.26]]}, {"text": "Once you’re inside, endless feeds remove stopping points, while unpredictable content keeps you anticipating the next swipe.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d7e57e9e5af4d54eb96823089f68894f1e3c5c80b856368266fb57e85e034ed8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.76], [5, 1.52, 1.82], [6, 1.82, 2.24], [7, 2.24, 2.58], [8, 2.58, 2.84], [9, 2.84, 3.4], [10, 3.4, 4.0], [11, 4.0, 4.3], [12, 4.3, 4.46], [13, 4.46, 5.0], [14, 5.0, 5.28], [15, 5.28, 5.54], [16, 5.54, 5.86]]}, {"text": "First-generation social-media limiting tools like Apple’s Screen Time, Unrot, and similar apps treat the problem like calorie restriction.", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3901e49e7bb82aa01dbc3b7d2acc3b3b0af932f7f65cf89786c08a8e07267d7b.mp3"}, {"text": "If you binge on social media in the morning, you don’t get to eat for the rest of the day.", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7e6ce758a19b5c7837eb1a3c3fc29a638eed37a018a121504456a3743fbcebae.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.54], [6, 1.54, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 1.72], [8, 1.72, 2.04], [9, 2.46, 2.66], [10, 2.66, 2.88], [11, 2.88, 3.0], [12, 3.0, 3.24], [13, 3.24, 3.4], [14, 3.4, 3.62], [15, 3.62, 3.72], [16, 3.72, 3.9], [17, 3.9, 4.1], [18, 4.1, 4.22], [19, 4.22, 4.42]]}, {"text": "But that’s not how real life works.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7a8e644356b16e4455212cb95cce91d77f50857c713c0edc541c229592445e44.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 1.0], [5, 1.0, 1.24], [6, 1.24, 1.58]]}, {"text": "If you spend your morning doomscrolling and then attend a networking event that evening, you may still need Instagram to follow up with someone you met.", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/78261eb3929e9788215ce9b03168886bbc212300df1f30dc29780eceb32952a3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.22], [2, 0.22, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.58], [4, 0.58, 0.78], [6, 1.4, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.82], [9, 2.08, 2.26], [10, 2.26, 2.54], [11, 2.54, 2.9], [12, 2.9, 3.1], [13, 3.1, 3.56], [14, 4.0, 4.06], [15, 4.06, 4.18], [16, 4.18, 4.38], [17, 4.38, 4.54], [18, 4.54, 5.04], [19, 5.04, 5.26], [20, 5.26, 5.52], [21, 5.52, 5.72], [22, 5.72, 5.8], [23, 5.8, 6.08], [24, 6.08, 6.24], [25, 6.24, 6.42]]}, {"text": "If someone at a coffee shop asks for your Instagram handle, you shouldn’t have to wait until your daily timer resets before connecting with them.", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fd324af4ff163288d9166f64b516e5bc56d2a1a2d96e697edde4b44c9d5a4d70.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.22], [6, 1.22, 1.66], [7, 1.66, 1.9], [8, 1.9, 2.02], [9, 2.02, 2.46], [10, 2.46, 2.9], [11, 3.32, 3.38], [12, 3.38, 3.66], [13, 3.66, 3.78], [14, 3.78, 3.96], [15, 3.96, 4.1], [16, 4.1, 4.46], [17, 4.46, 4.64], [18, 4.64, 4.88], [19, 4.88, 5.26], [20, 5.26, 5.72], [21, 5.72, 6.12], [22, 6.12, 6.44], [23, 6.44, 6.78], [24, 6.78, 7.0]]}, {"text": "So eventually, you disable the restriction.", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/87b6f911b53cb84cda902287765d390be361261e37d464e9605c9eed914a4acb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 0.92], [3, 0.92, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.82]]}, {"text": "And the loop starts again.", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c35ed071b03935b847037f0d8d5a04888b4a7dad0e21db4be2476e6c947ca4fd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.18]]}, {"text": "That led me to build NoLoop around a different constraint: preserve the parts of Instagram I deliberately use while removing the surfaces designed for open-ended consumption.", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/cf01f64d782991cf781bf8fc1d666b4a59b9400755141f88cc011fcea9d65a92.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.76], [4, 0.76, 0.98], [6, 1.56, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.3], [9, 2.3, 2.76], [10, 3.18, 3.42], [11, 3.42, 3.62], [12, 3.62, 3.84], [13, 3.84, 4.04], [14, 4.04, 4.52], [15, 4.52, 4.74], [16, 4.74, 5.06], [17, 5.06, 5.6], [18, 5.6, 5.8], [19, 5.8, 6.14], [20, 6.14, 6.32], [21, 6.32, 6.72], [22, 6.72, 7.22], [23, 7.22, 7.54], [25, 8.04, 8.54]]}, {"text": "NoLoop leaves profiles, Stories, posting, following, and messaging available, but removes surfaces like algorithmic feeds and recommendation loops.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/88a0c33a2b4df981029dbc2de2befd1c567773b3b98aeec269e269d47768dc87.mp3"}, {"text": "You don’t need to throw the baby out with the bathwater, nor do you need to starve yourself.", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f13a166f4bde2bd967429fc7b13a92ed5a15f75a39bc44302c19f6c4dcb3785c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.78], [5, 0.78, 0.94], [6, 0.94, 1.2], [7, 1.2, 1.42], [8, 1.42, 1.58], [9, 1.58, 1.68], [10, 1.68, 2.16], [11, 2.7, 2.84], [12, 2.84, 2.98], [13, 2.98, 3.08], [14, 3.08, 3.22], [15, 3.22, 3.42], [16, 3.42, 3.7], [17, 3.7, 4.12]]}, {"text": "Eat the healthy parts of social media and remove the loop.", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f68e914894530124b2a9bc67548d6eb457bb3cd6bd05f68440c2c6f28a496c8f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.38], [6, 1.38, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 1.9], [8, 1.9, 2.14], [9, 2.14, 2.4], [10, 2.4, 2.62]]}, {"text": "NoLoop, iOS", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f59a7b43f2c34da78ed4376f521f4f1a8a84b7f39311717659cc5566dd2a2c98.mp3"}]}